      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaghiro gha BWANA kwa wandu wake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli oreghorieghe nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Malagho ghose nakuzera, kughiandike chuonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ola matuku ghichacha nani nichaawiwunja wandu wapo Israeli na Juda kufuma wunyikenyi, wiwuye kwa isanga nerewinekieghe weke ndee jikaie jawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha nigho malagho BWANA ughighorie aighu ya wandu wa Israeli na Juda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA wa majeshi waghamba, “Ituku ijo nicharichikanya ghongolo rifume singonyi kwawo, na vilingo wifungilo navo; waghenyi ndewichaawibonya wikaie wadumiki wawo sena anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wichamdumikia BWANA Mlungu wawo; na umu wa kivalwa cha Daudi mzuri wawo, uo nichaammbusira kwa wundu ghwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
